2026-10-13T18:45:11.8039484Z [warning] MAIL IS NOT DELIVERABLE — this node accepts transactional email and discards it.
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8040190Z 
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8040573Z   adapter: Swoosh.Adapters.Local (local_mailbox)
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8040972Z 
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8041563Z Magic-link sign-in, password reset, email verification and access-grant
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8042710Z invitations will be ACCEPTED and never sent. The HTTP responses stay 200 by
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8043824Z design (anti-enumeration), so nothing else will tell you this.
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8044297Z 
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8045087Z Set SMTP_HOST (plus SMTP_PORT / SMTP_USERNAME / SMTP_PASSWORD as your relay
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8046239Z requires) to enable delivery — see deploy/smtp.env.example. Ignore this if
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8047736Z the box is not meant to send mail.
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8048065Z 
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8050858Z [warning] [Operator] The instance-operator allowlist is UNSET (BARKPARK_OPERATOR_EMAILS and BARKPARK_OPERATOR_TOKEN_IDS are
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8052175Z both empty), so the `admin` permission alone still opens these eight INSTANCE-GLOBAL
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8053082Z route groups to ANY admin-permissioned token, including one whose only membership is an
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8054005Z admin seat in a single workspace:
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8055321Z   1. POST|GET /v1/admin/self-update, POST /v1/admin/rollback, POST|GET /v1/admin/site-deploy
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8056198Z   2. GET /v1/plugins
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8056833Z   3. GET|PUT|DELETE /v1/plugins/settings/:plugin_name
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8057740Z   4. GET /v1/secrets, GET /v1/secrets/:name, GET /v1/secrets/:name/audit,
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8058795Z      PUT /v1/secrets/:name, DELETE /v1/secrets/:name
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8059679Z   5. POST /v1/status/incidents, POST /v1/status/incidents/:id/resolve
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8060354Z   6. POST /api/playground
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8060921Z   7. POST /api/workspaces/:workspace_slug/import
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8061651Z   8. GET /v1/instance/site-deploy, GET /v1/instance/metrics
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8062776Z On a SINGLE-TENANT instance that is fine — the only admin is the operator. On a
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8063911Z MULTI-TENANT one it hands your first customer-admin the instance: run-secrets in
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8065276Z cleartext, the instance-wide plugin credentials record, and the release itself.
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8066596Z Set BARKPARK_OPERATOR_EMAILS (comma-separated operator emails) and/or BARKPARK_OPERATOR_TOKEN_IDS
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8068208Z (comma-separated api_token ids) to arm the allowlist; once either is non-empty the
2026-10-13T18:45:11.8069126Z eight groups are allowlist-only and fail closed.
