_COST (1.0).", "name" => "costPerDash", "title" => "Cost per dash (bars)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "Base passive stamina regen. Source player.gd STAMINA_REGEN_PER_SEC = 1/19 ≈ 0.05263 (web 19s per bar). Speed-scaled up to 5× while sprinting.", "name" => "regenPerSec", "title" => "Regen per second (bars/s)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}], "name" => "stamina", "title" => "Stamina (energy bar)", "type" => "composite"}], "Player", false, "document", [], "5fd99805-55b0-4b4a-b7dd-c520f4a55849", "5ac3e9cd-90b0-4d1f-b2c7-26e8b2e118c5", "production", [], "user", [], "e22b02a5-ec4a-4a4e-a89d-9025415c67d3", "private", [], [], %{"jumpImpulse" => "5.0", "stamina" => %{"costPerDash" => "1.0", "max" => "4", "regenPerSec" => "0.05263"}, "title" => "Player", "turboMult" => "2.0", "walkSpeed" => "6.5"}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.320664Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.320664Z], "c9129567-9a2b-4d3b-9bc7-7b732c7c1d28"]
