 lasers check distToPlayer < 1.5).", "name" => "hitRadius", "title" => "Hit radius (units)", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "Damage dealt to the player on hit/detonation. projectile_types.gd MISSILE_DAMAGE 80.0 / LASER_DAMAGE 80.0. Thrown grenade is player-side (GRENADE_DETONATE_DAMAGE 450.0 to enemies).", "name" => "damage", "title" => "Damage to player", "type" => "string", "validation" => %{"pattern" => "^-?[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?$"}}, %{"description" => "True if the player can shoot the projectile down. Missiles carry MISSILE_BASE_HP (60) + a fat collision sphere; lasers cannot be destroyed.", "name" => "destroyable", "title" => "Destroyable (shootable)", "type" => "boolean"}, %{"description" => "The visual effect this projectile renders with (tint / trail / halo).", "name" => "vfx", "refType" => "vfx", "title" => "VFX", "type" => "reference"}], "Projectile Type", false, "document", [], "5fd99805-55b0-4b4a-b7dd-c520f4a55849", "5ac3e9cd-90b0-4d1f-b2c7-26e8b2e118c5", "production", [], "send", [], "e22b02a5-ec4a-4a4e-a89d-9025415c67d3", "private", [], [], %{"kind" => "homing"}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.344978Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.344978Z], "d4e80899-b726-470d-95e1-4707f98b8327"]
