, eg shrink-wrapped trade pack, filled dumpbin, filled counterpack", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.883027Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.883027Z], "e275211b-f8e6-4cad-9bb2-e5992ea383bf", "b8556e4a-9daa-4b08-be40-71c800773005", "Multiple-item pack", "Carrying multiple components, primarily for retailing as separate items. The pack may be split and retailed as separate items OR retailed as a single item. Use instead of Multiple-item trade-only pack (code 30) if the data provider specifically wishes to make explicit that the pack may optionally be retailed as a whole", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.883027Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.883027Z], "84dc369b-176f-445a-8afb-f359203c8082"]
