phens)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], "10de75e2-92e2-469d-9c3b-9a0458e03dfa", "1668d855-3fe6-4e2e-8671-26b200f6c779", "UPC", "UPC product number (12 digits, without spaces or hyphens)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], "26b5c677-682b-4032-98ba-60e1117bc2c1", "31fc3686-19c1-49a9-bc25-f0eadbe24d36", "ISMN-10", "International Standard Music Number, pre-2008 (M plus nine digits, without spaces or hyphens) – now Deprecated in ONIX for Books, except where providing historical information for compatibility with legacy systems. It should only be used in relation to products published before 2008 – when ISMN-13 superseded it – and should never be used as the ONLY identifier (it should always be accompanied by the correct GTIN-12 / ISMN-13)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], "c178cf70-6277-4d68-aefa-cc6e0ee82b82", "fb5051c6-a3d4-4918-a54c-ff242c8a0a79", "DOI", "Digital Object Identifier (variable length and character set, beginning ‘10.’ and without https://doi.org/ or the older http://dx.doi.org/)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], "a45f5941-5df3-487c-bb12-dcbe93c77efd", "382ca875-5e16-4318-a58a-88dca2bda1f2", "LCCN", "Library of Congress Control Number in normalized form (up to 12 characters, alphanumeric)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:12.899391Z], "5b272f30-b775-4521-908c-8a563b553577", "074787a8-7f2a-48de-8318-7bef1874827e", ...]
