which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], "7e5fb6d5-b4cb-41da-b9b0-2e852939382a", "052576b9-cd9b-45b6-b5df-fe4c2ff67ed3", "Thickness", "For a book, the overall thickness of the spine. For a folded map, the thickness when folded. For packaged products, the depth of the retail packaging, and for trade-only products, the depth of the trade packaging. In general, the thickness or depth of a product in the form in which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], "570d1042-7f55-4375-b25d-3647ca79dc43", "efb7252e-1698-4073-b5e4-a9dd66c95f2d", "Page trim height", "Overall height (code 01) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], "6b98c409-2964-40c8-9da1-99fbb6ef18f0", "197960a1-d017-4767-bc2f-fbc3de3be4db", "Page trim width", "Overall width (code 02) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang and spine thickness for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], "8e38d877-5f4d-4b7b-8d71-e0f2f0f32504", "57c070e2-a3cb-44d1-8c30-e87557173ba8", "Unit volume", "The volume of the product, including any retail packaging. Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.095236Z], "0ddb887f-769d-4f43-8ee0-a0cfccfacd52", "82fd9eb0-1f4b-4a40-9877-ba79f7272e73", "Unit capacity", "Volume of the internal (fluid) contents of a product (eg of paint in a can). Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18: