026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], "f1005a19-9f7d-4621-8ee7-4c4b2e75cf75", "308a8251-154a-4377-84f5-f5ab9d751e0c", "Not yet available", "Product is not yet available (requires expected date, either as <ExpectedShipDate> (ONIX 2.1) or as <SupplyDate> with <SupplyDateRole> coded ‘08’ (ONIX 3.0 or later), except in exceptional circumstances where no date is known)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], "32135773-7e80-4fbe-9e98-7b5d09ccd7f1", "d86c30a4-b801-4db0-8a1f-98a6375e384d", "Awaiting stock", "Product is not yet available, but will be a stock item when available (requires expected date, either as <ExpectedShipDate> (ONIX 2.1) or as <SupplyDate> with <SupplyDateRole> coded ‘08’ (ONIX 3.0 or later), except in exceptional circumstances where no date is known). Used particularly for imports which have been published in the country of origin but have not yet arrived in the importing country", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], "53656bea-fba8-43e4-8d0a-91334c4c8364", "6ddd8beb-ea51-47aa-8409-3a3b48959b3e", "Not yet available, will be POD", "Product is not yet available, to be published as print-on-demand only (requires expected date, either as <ExpectedShipDate> (ONIX 2.1) or as <SupplyDate> with <SupplyDateRole> coded ‘08’ (ONIX 3.0 or later), except in exceptional circumstances where no date is known). May apply either to a POD successor to an existing conventional edition, when the successor will be published under a different ISBN (normally because different trade terms apply); or to a title that is being published as a POD original", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], "89216bbc-0fa1-4fe8-a22d-2c8cab51abcb", "c97bfafd-14f5-4338-9d3b-412f4e2e6597", "Available", "Product is available from the supplier (form of availability unspecified)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:45:13.202676Z], "a1f75023-0262-4338-9b3e-861f3e6caf82", "924f306f-a88c